```

2. Wrap your ScrollView component with a View that will handle the focus and scrolling logic.

```javascript
<View style={{ flex: 1 }}>
  <ScrollView
    // ... other ScrollView props
    onScroll={handleScroll}
    ref={scrollRef}
  />
</View>
```

3. Define the `handleScroll` function to update the focused section based on the scroll position.

```javascript
const handleScroll = () => {
  const offset = scrollRef.current.getScrollOffset();
  const height = scrollRef.current.getContentSize().height;

  if (offset > height - 100) {
    // Scrolled past the last section, so focus on the next section
    setFocusedSection((prevSection) => prevSection + 1);
  }
};
